  (text "Series R in each UART7 line: 1k on RX limits current into an unpowered CM4 from the bridge, 330R on TX. TP1/TP2 (bottom): short to TP3 to reset; hold TP2 low through a reset for maskrom.\nTP4-TP6 (bottom): USB D-, D+, GND of the download port, for rkdeveloptool in maskrom. TP7: GPIO7 / PWM0_CH0_M1 (pin 37) for a servo" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 407 390 0)
